author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce with an extension that declares --many on a command and its subcommand, recording the delivered order on the built CLI; Occurrences recorded by every scope are merged by their position in the original argv, so pm parent child --many=false --many delivers [false, true]; An in-process spec covers parent-consumed bare, leaf-only attached and a token consumed as another option's value across scopes"
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: low
confidence: medium
expected_result: Every occurrence of a repeatable switch reaches the handler in argv order whichever command scope consumed it
